<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>When to all who love His coming He shall speak</l><l>the word, “Arise!”</l><l>Oh, how blessed for that summons to be free!</l><l>With what rapture we shall greet Him as we</l><l>join Him in the skies—</l><l>What a meeting, what a meeting that will be!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Now in all the local churches we are meeting</l><l>day by day</l><l>And expecting any moment Christ to see,</l><l>But when Jesus comes the meeting starts that</l><l>ne’er will pass away—</l><l>What a meeting, what a meeting that will be!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Even now while we are meeting, Lord, we hope</l><l>to see Thy face</l><l>And forever without ceasing be with Thee.</l><l>Then we’ll just go right on meeting in another</l><l>meeting place—</l><l>What a meeting, what a meeting this will be!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
